### Oxide Bot Monitor API Testing (.http)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@simulatorUrl = http://localhost:8788

### 1. Healthcheck
GET http://localhost:5000/health
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Get All Bots (with metrics and task states)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bots
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Get Bot Details by ID (bot-01, bot-02, bot-03, etc.)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bots/bot-02
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Send Command to Bot (start / stop / restart / status)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bots/bot-02/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "stop"
}

### 5. Send Start Command to Bot
POST {{baseUrl}}/bots/bot-02/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "start"
}

### 6. Get Overview Summary Metrics (Online, Active, Standby, In Progress)
GET {{baseUrl}}/summary
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. Get Kill-Switch State
GET {{baseUrl}}/kill-switch
Content-Type: application/json

### 8. Enable Kill-Switch (Halt all bot order operations)
POST {{baseUrl}}/kill-switch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enable": false
}

### 9. Disable Kill-Switch (Resume normal bot operations)
POST {{baseUrl}}/kill-switch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enable": true
}

### 10. List Code Deployment Packages
GET {{baseUrl}}/packages
Content-Type: application/json

### 11. Pack New Code Package Version
POST {{baseUrl}}/packages/pack
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 12. Deploy Package to All Online Bots
POST {{baseUrl}}/packages/deploy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "packageId": "pkg-01"
}

### 13. Deploy Package to a Specific Bot
POST {{baseUrl}}/packages/deploy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "packageId": "pkg-01",
  "targetBotId": "bot-03"
}

### 14. List Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

### 15. Create New Order (Pending)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalOrderId": "ORD-TEST-9901",
  "amount": 350.00,
  "currency": "THB"
}

### 16. Dispatch Order to Bot (SKIP LOCKED Concurrency Safe)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/dispatch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "botId": "bot-02"
}

### 17. Mark Order Completed
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/complete
Content-Type: application/json

### 18. Audit Logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs
Content-Type: application/json

### 19. Simulator Health (Port 8788)
GET {{simulatorUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

### 20. Simulator Bots (Port 8788)
GET {{simulatorUrl}}/bots
Content-Type: application/json
